            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "客户购买什么，生产怎样接到订单？",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "酵母、酵母抽提物及相关生物产品服务烘焙、食品调味、发酵工业和营养等客户。2025年报物理9—10页披露，常规品依据库存和需求生产，非常规品按订单生产，经销、大客户直供及电商连接客户。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "糖蜜、能源、应用技术服务和产能爬坡影响成本与现金。合并范围还包括包材、制糖和融资租赁，酵母业务的回报分析需要对应的利润、资本与现金分表。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "Re0aacfad8631",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "增长加快，利润和现金为何落后？",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "2025收入+10.08%、归母+16.60%、CFO+50.19%；2026前三季收入+15.45%、归母仅+4.90%、CFO-22.8%，Q3归母-8.46%。这组分化使销量净价、原料能源、汇率与资金占用需要分别解释。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "mechanism"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "alternative"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "variables"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "invalidate"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "gap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "2026H1收入+16.30%、归母+10.21%、CFO-23.79%。前三季收入快于利润、现金承压的表现，需要从应收、库存和现金税、结算时点入手，再与资本支出研究衔接。",
          "anchors": [
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "claim"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
              "field": "evidence"
            },
            {
              "card": "Rc307bcec6202",
